<title>BELGIUM: EU Commission economic forecast for Britain.</title>
<headline>EU Commission economic forecast for Britain.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following are the economic forecasts by the European Commission for Britain -</p>
<p>				     1996	 1997</p>
<p> GDP growth (pct)		 2.3	  3.0</p>
<p> Investment			 8.8	  7.2</p>
<p> GDP price deflator (pct)     2.5	  2.4</p>
<p> Unemployment (pct)	     8.3	  7.8</p>
<p> Public sector deficit	  4.6	  3.5</p>
<p>(pct of GDP)</p>
<p> Debt/GDP ratio		  56.2	 57.0</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6830</p>
</text>
